## 📄 فایل `.gitignore` پیشنهادی

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
env/
venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# Data files
data/
*.json
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Package files
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
